    {
        "content": "<p><a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/a08dc72dd43698ba5488a00ab03831d11a749c38/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/FunInd.lean#L349-L350\">https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/a08dc72dd43698ba5488a00ab03831d11a749c38/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/FunInd.lean#L349-L350</a></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Sometimes Fix.lean abstracts over oldIH in a proof definition. So delta-beta-reduce that definition. We <em>need to look through theorems</em> here!</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>... that doesn't sound great (theorem bodies are always unexposed)</p>",
