    {
        "content": "<p>Yes, this will be hard to fix given the module system. A proper fix is to avoid this abstraction, and I have a rough idea how to do it, but it’s invasive.</p>\n<p>For now the best we can do is to print a better error message here, and suggest to generate the functional induction theorem in the original module eagerly (or maybe try <code>import all</code>).</p>\n<p>Not sure if anyone has bothered to report this issue yet; if not feel free to.</p>",
        "id": 607478210,
        "sender_full_name": "Joachim Breitner",
        "timestamp": 1782855648
    }
